{"term": {"label": "禮", "occurrences": 3, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i", "title": "告子上", "description": "告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "內", "id": "內"}, {"form": "受", "id": "受"}, {"form": "在", "id": "在"}, {"form": "外", "id": "外"}, {"form": "弗", "id": "弗"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "敬", "id": "敬"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "父", "id": "父"}, {"form": "由", "id": "由"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "舍", "id": "舍"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}, {"form": "鄉", "id": "郷"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.0349529867072724, "source": "身", "target": "受"}, {"weight": 2.5649493574615367, "source": "身", "target": "死"}, {"weight": 2.6984807500860595, "source": "身", "target": "郷"}, {"weight": 1.466337068793427, "source": "死", "target": "弗"}, {"weight": 2.747270914255491, "source": "死", "target": "受"}, {"weight": 2.4107986776342782, "source": "死", "target": "郷"}, {"weight": 0.256133714716855, "source": "心", "target": "敬"}, {"weight": 0.5926059513380679, "source": "心", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.35621717327383756, "source": "心", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.1034315751040586, "source": "心", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.2944868118667678, "source": "舍", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.4471663218051534, "source": "舍", "target": "弗"}, {"weight": 2.629487878599108, "source": "舍", "target": "由"}, {"weight": 1.9363406980391626, "source": "受", "target": "弗"}, {"weight": 2.629487878599108, "source": "受", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 0.7836611881007772, "source": "受", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.880802306880014, "source": "受", "target": "郷"}, {"weight": 1.9363406980391626, "source": "弗", "target": "由"}, {"weight": 1.4122698475231514, "source": "外", "target": "義"}, {"